    "body": "Hmmm. Yeah I spent some time looking at this but must've been too deep to realize that this could probably just be simplified. I don't think we should have different inheritance rules for origin and about base URL, and additionally I don't think those should differ between the about:blank and about:srcdoc cases, so I actually think we can just collapse the If/Otherwise here, and always use the initiator origin snapshot.\r\n\r\nI think I'll make the conditional be `If url is about:blank or about:srcdoc, then:` to be compatible with the existing spec, but please see https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9488 about going through \"matches about:blank` possibly.",
